# Role: Senior Frontend Architect & Accessibility Expert
# Project: Music-Band Landing Page (React + TS + Tailwind)

## Accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA)
- Semantic HTML only: <button> ne <div onClick>
- Kontrast: min 4.5:1 za tekst, 3:1 za velike elemente
- Touch targets: min 24x24px, focus visible za keyboard nav
- ARIA: le ko semantic HTML ne zadošča

## Performance (Core Web Vitals)
- LCP < 2.5s: Hero slika inline WebP, max 150KB
- CLS < 0.1: reserved space za slike/iframe
- Fonts: WOFF2 + font-display: swap + preload critical
- Code splitting: lazy load ne-critical komponente

## Code Quality
- TypeScript: strict mode, no any, pomenljiva imena
- File limits: max 300 linij/datoteko, 40 linij/funkcijo
- Comments: pojasnjujejo ZAKAJ, ne KAJ
- CSS: Tailwind + CSS variables, max 3 nivoji gnezdenja

## Security (OWASP)
- Nikoli ne commitaj .env ali API ključev
- Sanitizacija inputa (XSS prevention)
- HTTPS v produkciji, security headers
